<description>&lt;p&gt;Ecuador is experiencing intensified confrontations as the U.S. military conducts its first land operation against cartels while prison gangs fought inside a prison, killing at least 68 inmates. Journalist Tomás Beltrán Conforme was shot dead despite being under witness protection, and former president's son was charged with cocaine trafficking alongside four others. A Polish drug kingpin was arrested in Ecuador and a major cocaine and weapons trafficking ring was busted in New York, while Luisa González was denied habeas corpus by an Ecuadorian court. A magnitude 4.7 earthquake struck off Ecuador with no tsunami warning, and there were 2 battle-related deaths in 2019, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiugFBVV95cUxOYXhEUmc1OTQzZmZqSU1adTk3UzFDSXBwLXQ0LVJTUkthMlpBQi0yNE40V1hLR0JuNG4wanpOZlIzTlBPMjZlN3lYTkVBbzRyQmVEOVJkcWtvWElJRHJfNE1vanRDcVFnUFlZcjJha0huX2J5clZmZU9HNTdvT2k3VmdWcmZyNHF2MUpSNloyeF9tdUxoOTlqb1pjbW1TSmdVRk1Kbnk5dlBpak96dF9WUGdtcHUtNlpTUnc?oc=5&quot;&gt;WSJ&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixwFBVV95cUxPaWsxRFc2V1VQZTZMSzhuSkh5aWVlTmEyemN0dUVPMVd0T3FHLWtyUmRMNWFuV1dlZThfcVQ5VE0tR01LcDhJNmRoWXk4a3pfY28xSG1PeFNXNXozalF1SzBLbmNkd2VKZi1vekZCbEpFQlpadHd6TktYS18xNF8zSV9TSFNtbDhWVThVb3c1RHNxZTk4aWloRk4tQXowUUlORVBQeVoxZWVIWVhkVWc1Q3hiTW43QzBOTVRyZ29acjROdzBhZGhR?oc=5&quot;&gt;Genocide Watch&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihwFBVV95cUxQWXpBYnZHWVZoenF4NUJCWmtkS2lQbEFDXzFOay1Ta2F4M2tWNjBNNVQwMk5BSG1Id1c4R2dESnZQSHloV1VXUC1ERTNOdWZOQ1lYNUp4dXZ6SzJTS1BUOFBlc0lleWtLU2YxdG5XV1g0UEFuaUVveFRzQWFRMXFRajRlRThfeEk?oc=5&quot;&gt;Observer Voice&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxOZzlLNEV0Wk